    "adaptation": "Grey Wolf maps to the exact native Wolf content identity. Root piercing Attack6 and ordinary Attack1 use the authored bite Attack1; critical Attack2 uses Attack2. No ranged/casting/jump mapping is invented. Fifteen meaningful 64 px columns per selected sheet; named direction Idle PNGs match the corresponding With shadow atlas rows byte-for-byte in E, SE, S, SW, W, NW, N, NE order. 12 fps and support pixel (32,42), origin_y_from_ground 22, are reviewed execution choices, not vendor metadata. Shadowless body remains unchanged; no separate shadow media is supplied. Smaller sheet cells remain rig geometry, independent of native creature size."
